le=\"font-size: medium;\">תהיה עני</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">יין תירוש</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">תבקש רשות</span></span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מה פירוש המילה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">בְּעִירְכֶם</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">?</span></span></span></li><ol style=\"font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-weight: 400;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">הבהמות שלכם</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">האש שהבערתם</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">רשות מקומית</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אני אהיה בעדכם</span></span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מיהו&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">מַלְכִּיאֵל</span><span face=\"Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">?</span></span></span></span></li><ol style=\"font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-weight: 400;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">המלאך שהתלווה ליעקב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אביו של פרעה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מושל העיר גושן</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בנו של אשר</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">פּוֹטִי-פֶרַע זה:</span><